{"id":"3997bfb78544d69c","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-effective-computation.md","title":"Finite Register Programs and Computability","display":"df-effective-computation — Finite Register Programs and Computability","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-effective-computation","aliases":["89-df-effective-computation"],"display":"df-effective-computation — Finite Register Programs and Computability","depends_on":["[[89-df-function]]","[[89-df-omega]]"],"created":"2026-10-09","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-effective-computation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-effective-computation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-effective-computation — Finite Register Programs and Computability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0d71e87a2f416230\" href=\"?note=0d71e87a2f416230\" title=\"89-df-function\">89-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7ad117274f74965a\" href=\"?note=7ad117274f74965a\" title=\"89-df-omega\">89-df-omega</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-09"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(X\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> 为 oracle；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{H},\\mathsf{I},\\mathsf{D},\\mathsf{Q}\">\\(\\mathsf{H},\\mathsf{I},\\mathsf{D},\\mathsf{Q}\\)</span> 是互异指令标签。程序有限，寄存器值和指令地址为自然数，未列出的寄存器值为零。</li>\n<li>输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\">\\(\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\)</span> 放在编号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,\\ldots,k-1\">\\(0,\\ldots,k-1\\)</span> 的寄存器；输出为寄存器 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。配置为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(j,r)\">\\((j,r)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r:\\omega\\to\\omega\">\\(r:\\omega\\to\\omega\\)</span> 有有限非零支集。有限运行证书使用下述固定长度寄存器向量编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{seq},\\mathsf{unseq}\">\\(\\mathsf{seq},\\mathsf{unseq}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0d71e87a2f416230\" href=\"?note=0d71e87a2f416230\" title=\"89-df-function\">89-df-function</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,E\">\\(D,E\\)</span> 为给定的编码域；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_D:D\\to\\omega\">\\(c_D:D\\to\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_E:E\\to\\omega\">\\(c_E:E\\to\\omega\\)</span> 为指定单射，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:D\\to E\">\\(f:D\\to E\\)</span>。每次使用省略下标的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comp}(f)\">\\(\\operatorname{Comp}(f)\\)</span>，必须固定同一对声明域编码；下述等式是该省略记法的定义。自然数子集使用恒等编码的限制，公式使用其原有 Gödel 编码；有限序列和附加失败标记使用下述构造，不另选未声明的“标准编码”。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathsf{Prog}\">\\(P\\in\\mathsf{Prog}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q,q&#39;,i,j,y,a,w\\in\\omega\">\\(q,q&#39;,i,j,y,a,w\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r,r&#39;\\in\\mathsf{Reg}\">\\(r,r&#39;\\in\\mathsf{Reg}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\">\\(\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(T\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Step},\\operatorname{Run},\\operatorname{Halt},\\mathsf{Trace},\\mathsf{Acc}\">\\(\\operatorname{Step},\\operatorname{Run},\\operatorname{Halt},\\mathsf{Trace},\\mathsf{Acc}\\)</span> 的量词中，自然数索引与寄存器状态分别取这些域。</li>\n<li>编码构造中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in D^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(s\\in D^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in D\">\\(x\\in D\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in E\">\\(y\\in E\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\star\\notin D\">\\(\\star\\notin D\\)</span>。元组的有序对与有限序列类型仍按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0d71e87a2f416230\" href=\"?note=0d71e87a2f416230\" title=\"89-df-function\">89-df-function</a> 区分。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}computation}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Ins}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf H\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf I(i,j)\\mid i,j\\in\\omega\\}\n\\cup\\{\\mathsf D(i,j,k),\\mathsf Q(i,j,k)\\mid i,j,k\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Prog}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Ins}^{&lt;\\omega},\\quad\n\\mathsf{Reg}\\coloneqq\\{r\\in\\omega^\\omega\\mid\\exists n\\ \\forall i\\ge n\\ r(i)=0\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Step}_X(P,(q,r),(q&#39;,r&#39;))&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow q&lt;|P|\\land\\Bigl(\n\\exists i,j\\,[P_q=\\mathsf I(i,j)\\land q&#39;=j\\land r&#39;=r[i\\mapsto r(i)+1]]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor\\exists i,j,k\\,[P_q=\\mathsf D(i,j,k)\\land\n((r(i)=0\\land q&#39;=j\\land r&#39;=r)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{48mm}\\lor(r(i)&gt;0\\land q&#39;=k\\land r&#39;=r[i\\mapsto r(i)-1]))]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor\\exists i,j,k\\,[P_q=\\mathsf Q(i,j,k)\\land r&#39;=r\\land\n((r(i)\\in X\\land q&#39;=j)\\lor(r(i)\\notin X\\land q&#39;=k))]\\Bigr),\\\\\nr_{\\vec x}(i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}x_i,&amp;i&lt;|\\vec x|,\\\\0,&amp;i\\ge|\\vec x|,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{Run}_X(P,\\vec x,s)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\ns\\in(\\omega\\times\\mathsf{Reg})^{&lt;\\omega}\\land |s|&gt;0\\land s_0=(0,r_{\\vec x})\\land\n\\forall i+1&lt;|s|\\ \\operatorname{Step}_X(P,s_i,s_{i+1}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Halt}_X(P,\\vec x,y)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists s,q,r\\,[\\operatorname{Run}_X(P,\\vec x,s)\\land s_{|s|-1}=(q,r)\n\\land q&lt;|P|\\land P_q=\\mathsf H\\land r(0)=y],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Comp}^{X}_k(f)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(f:\\omega^k\\to\\omega)\\land\n\\exists P\\in\\mathsf{Prog}\\ \\forall\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\ \\operatorname{Halt}_X(P,\\vec x,f(\\vec x)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Comp}_{c_D,c_E}(f)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(f:D\\to E)\\land\n\\exists P\\in\\mathsf{Prog}\\ \\forall x\\in D\\ \\operatorname{Halt}_{\\varnothing}(P,\\langle c_D(x)\\rangle,c_E(f(x))),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Rec}^{X}_k&amp;\\coloneqq\\{R\\subseteq\\omega^k\\mid\\operatorname{Comp}^{X}_k(\\mathbf1_R)\\},\\quad\n\\mathbf1_R(\\vec x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;\\vec x\\in R,\\\\0,&amp;\\vec x\\notin R,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\n\\mathsf{idx}(\\mathsf H)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\mathsf{idx}(\\mathsf I(i,j))\\coloneqq\\{i\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{idx}(\\mathsf D(i,j,k))=\\mathsf{idx}(\\mathsf Q(i,j,k))\\coloneqq\\{i\\},\\\\\nK(P,k)&amp;\\coloneqq1+\\max\\bigl(\\{k\\}\\cup\\bigcup_{j&lt;|P|}\\mathsf{idx}(P_j)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathsf{conf}_{P,k}(a)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{(q,r)\\in\\omega\\times\\mathsf{Reg}\\mid\\exists s\\in\\omega^{K(P,k)}\\\\\n[a=\\mathsf{seq}(\\langle q\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}s)\\land\n\\forall i&lt;K(P,k)\\ r(i)=s_i\\land\\forall i\\ge K(P,k)\\ r(i)=0]\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Trace}_X(P,\\vec x,w,y)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists s\\,[\\operatorname{Run}_X(P,\\vec x,s)\\land\n|s|=|\\mathsf{unseq}(w)|\\land\n\\forall i&lt;|s|\\ s_i\\in\\mathsf{conf}_{P,|\\vec x|}(\\mathsf{unseq}(w)_i)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\exists q,r\\ (s_{|s|-1}=(q,r)\\land q&lt;|P|\\land P_q=\\mathsf H\\land r(0)=y)],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Acc}(P,a,w)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists y\\ \\mathsf{Trace}_{\\varnothing}(P,\\langle a\\rangle,w,y),\\\\\n\\operatorname{RE}(T)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists P\\in\\mathsf{Prog}\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (n\\in T\\leftrightarrow\\exists y\\ \\operatorname{Halt}_{\\varnothing}(P,\\langle n\\rangle,y)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Comp}(f)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Comp}_{\\operatorname{id}_\\omega,\\operatorname{id}_\\omega}(f)\n\\quad(f:\\omega\\to\\omega).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}computation}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Ins}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf H\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf I(i,j)\\mid i,j\\in\\omega\\}\n\\cup\\{\\mathsf D(i,j,k),\\mathsf Q(i,j,k)\\mid i,j,k\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Prog}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Ins}^{&lt;\\omega},\\quad\n\\mathsf{Reg}\\coloneqq\\{r\\in\\omega^\\omega\\mid\\exists n\\ \\forall i\\ge n\\ r(i)=0\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Step}_X(P,(q,r),(q&#39;,r&#39;))&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow q&lt;|P|\\land\\Bigl(\n\\exists i,j\\,[P_q=\\mathsf I(i,j)\\land q&#39;=j\\land r&#39;=r[i\\mapsto r(i)+1]]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor\\exists i,j,k\\,[P_q=\\mathsf D(i,j,k)\\land\n((r(i)=0\\land q&#39;=j\\land r&#39;=r)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{48mm}\\lor(r(i)&gt;0\\land q&#39;=k\\land r&#39;=r[i\\mapsto r(i)-1]))]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor\\exists i,j,k\\,[P_q=\\mathsf Q(i,j,k)\\land r&#39;=r\\land\n((r(i)\\in X\\land q&#39;=j)\\lor(r(i)\\notin X\\land q&#39;=k))]\\Bigr),\\\\\nr_{\\vec x}(i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}x_i,&amp;i&lt;|\\vec x|,\\\\0,&amp;i\\ge|\\vec x|,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{Run}_X(P,\\vec x,s)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\ns\\in(\\omega\\times\\mathsf{Reg})^{&lt;\\omega}\\land |s|&gt;0\\land s_0=(0,r_{\\vec x})\\land\n\\forall i+1&lt;|s|\\ \\operatorname{Step}_X(P,s_i,s_{i+1}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Halt}_X(P,\\vec x,y)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists s,q,r\\,[\\operatorname{Run}_X(P,\\vec x,s)\\land s_{|s|-1}=(q,r)\n\\land q&lt;|P|\\land P_q=\\mathsf H\\land r(0)=y],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Comp}^{X}_k(f)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(f:\\omega^k\\to\\omega)\\land\n\\exists P\\in\\mathsf{Prog}\\ \\forall\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\ \\operatorname{Halt}_X(P,\\vec x,f(\\vec x)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Comp}_{c_D,c_E}(f)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(f:D\\to E)\\land\n\\exists P\\in\\mathsf{Prog}\\ \\forall x\\in D\\ \\operatorname{Halt}_{\\varnothing}(P,\\langle c_D(x)\\rangle,c_E(f(x))),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Rec}^{X}_k&amp;\\coloneqq\\{R\\subseteq\\omega^k\\mid\\operatorname{Comp}^{X}_k(\\mathbf1_R)\\},\\quad\n\\mathbf1_R(\\vec x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;\\vec x\\in R,\\\\0,&amp;\\vec x\\notin R,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\n\\mathsf{idx}(\\mathsf H)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\mathsf{idx}(\\mathsf I(i,j))\\coloneqq\\{i\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{idx}(\\mathsf D(i,j,k))=\\mathsf{idx}(\\mathsf Q(i,j,k))\\coloneqq\\{i\\},\\\\\nK(P,k)&amp;\\coloneqq1+\\max\\bigl(\\{k\\}\\cup\\bigcup_{j&lt;|P|}\\mathsf{idx}(P_j)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathsf{conf}_{P,k}(a)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{(q,r)\\in\\omega\\times\\mathsf{Reg}\\mid\\exists s\\in\\omega^{K(P,k)}\\\\\n[a=\\mathsf{seq}(\\langle q\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}s)\\land\n\\forall i&lt;K(P,k)\\ r(i)=s_i\\land\\forall i\\ge K(P,k)\\ r(i)=0]\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Trace}_X(P,\\vec x,w,y)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists s\\,[\\operatorname{Run}_X(P,\\vec x,s)\\land\n|s|=|\\mathsf{unseq}(w)|\\land\n\\forall i&lt;|s|\\ s_i\\in\\mathsf{conf}_{P,|\\vec x|}(\\mathsf{unseq}(w)_i)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\exists q,r\\ (s_{|s|-1}=(q,r)\\land q&lt;|P|\\land P_q=\\mathsf H\\land r(0)=y)],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Acc}(P,a,w)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists y\\ \\mathsf{Trace}_{\\varnothing}(P,\\langle a\\rangle,w,y),\\\\\n\\operatorname{RE}(T)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists P\\in\\mathsf{Prog}\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (n\\in T\\leftrightarrow\\exists y\\ \\operatorname{Halt}_{\\varnothing}(P,\\langle n\\rangle,y)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Comp}(f)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Comp}_{\\operatorname{id}_\\omega,\\operatorname{id}_\\omega}(f)\n\\quad(f:\\omega\\to\\omega).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{CodeSeq}_{c_D}(s)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf{seq}(\\langle c_D(s_i)\\mid i&lt;|s|\\rangle)\n\\quad(s\\in D^{&lt;\\omega}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{CodePair}_{c_D,c_E}(\\langle x,y\\rangle_{\\rm pair})&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\pi(c_D(x),c_E(y))\\quad(x\\in D,y\\in E),\\\\\n\\mathsf{CodeFail}_{c_D,\\star}(z)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}0,&amp;z=\\star,\\\\1+c_D(z),&amp;z\\in D,\\end{cases}\n\\quad(z\\in D\\cup\\{\\star\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Inj}(\\mathsf{CodeSeq}_{c_D})&amp;\\land\n\\operatorname{Inj}(\\mathsf{CodePair}_{c_D,c_E})\\land\n\\operatorname{Inj}(\\mathsf{CodeFail}_{c_D,\\star}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Comp}(f)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Comp}_{c_D,c_E}(f)\n\\quad(f:D\\to E),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Comp}_{c_D,c_E}(f)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists P\\in\\mathsf{Prog}\\ \\forall x\\in D\\ \\exists w\\in\\omega\\\n\\mathsf{Trace}_{\\varnothing}(P,\\langle c_D(x)\\rangle,w,c_E(f(x))),\\\\\nc_D&amp;=\\{\\langle n,n\\rangle\\mid n\\in D\\}\n\\quad(D\\subseteq\\omega),\\qquad\nc_E=\\{\\langle n,n\\rangle\\mid n\\in E\\}\\quad(E\\subseteq\\omega).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{CodeSeq}_{c_D}(s)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf{seq}(\\langle c_D(s_i)\\mid i&lt;|s|\\rangle)\n\\quad(s\\in D^{&lt;\\omega}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{CodePair}_{c_D,c_E}(\\langle x,y\\rangle_{\\rm pair})&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\pi(c_D(x),c_E(y))\\quad(x\\in D,y\\in E),\\\\\n\\mathsf{CodeFail}_{c_D,\\star}(z)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}0,&amp;z=\\star,\\\\1+c_D(z),&amp;z\\in D,\\end{cases}\n\\quad(z\\in D\\cup\\{\\star\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Inj}(\\mathsf{CodeSeq}_{c_D})&amp;\\land\n\\operatorname{Inj}(\\mathsf{CodePair}_{c_D,c_E})\\land\n\\operatorname{Inj}(\\mathsf{CodeFail}_{c_D,\\star}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Comp}(f)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Comp}_{c_D,c_E}(f)\n\\quad(f:D\\to E),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Comp}_{c_D,c_E}(f)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists P\\in\\mathsf{Prog}\\ \\forall x\\in D\\ \\exists w\\in\\omega\\\n\\mathsf{Trace}_{\\varnothing}(P,\\langle c_D(x)\\rangle,w,c_E(f(x))),\\\\\nc_D&amp;=\\{\\langle n,n\\rangle\\mid n\\in D\\}\n\\quad(D\\subseteq\\omega),\\qquad\nc_E=\\{\\langle n,n\\rangle\\mid n\\in E\\}\\quad(E\\subseteq\\omega).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1_Y(n)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;n\\in Y,\\\\0,&amp;n\\notin Y,\\end{cases}\n\\quad(Y\\subseteq\\omega,n\\in\\omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf1_Y(n)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;n\\in Y,\\\\0,&amp;n\\notin Y,\\end{cases}\n\\quad(Y\\subseteq\\omega,n\\in\\omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>越界指令地址既不产生后继配置也不算停机。非停机输入不被误判为否。该有限寄存器机模型固定了“有限程序”和 oracle 查询的含义；不对程序执行时间作不必要的模型无关断言。</p>\n<p>编码域外的自然数不属于该次调用的输入域；本条不把域上总可计算性改成对所有非法码也必须停机。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"0d71e87a2f416230","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"7ad117274f74965a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"0d71e87a2f416230","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"输入 $\\vec x\\in\\omega^k$ 放在编号 $0,\\ldots,k-1$ 的寄存器；输出为寄存器 $0$。配置为 $(j,r)$，$r:\\omega\\to\\omega$ 有有限非零支集。有限运行证书使用下述固定长度寄存器向量编码；$\\mathsf{seq},\\mathsf{unseq}$ 取 [[89-df-function]]。","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"0d71e87a2f416230","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"编码构造中的 $s\\in D^{<\\omega}$、$x\\in D$、$y\\in E$；$\\star\\notin D$。元组的有序对与有限序列类型仍按 [[89-df-function]] 区分。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{H},\\mathsf{I},\\mathsf{D},\\mathsf{Q}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x\\in\\omega^k","display":false},{"tex":"0,\\ldots,k-1","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"(j,r)","display":false},{"tex":"r:\\omega\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{seq},\\mathsf{unseq}","display":false},{"tex":"D,E","display":false},{"tex":"c_D:D\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"c_E:E\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"f:D\\to E","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Comp}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"P\\in\\mathsf{Prog}","display":false},{"tex":"q,q',i,j,y,a,w\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"r,r'\\in\\mathsf{Reg}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x\\in\\omega^k","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Step},\\operatorname{Run},\\operatorname{Halt},\\mathsf{Trace},\\mathsf{Acc}","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in D^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in D","display":false},{"tex":"y\\in E","display":false},{"tex":"\\star\\notin D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}computation}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Ins}&\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf H\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf I(i,j)\\mid i,j\\in\\omega\\}\n\\cup\\{\\mathsf D(i,j,k),\\mathsf Q(i,j,k)\\mid i,j,k\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Prog}&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Ins}^{<\\omega},\\quad\n\\mathsf{Reg}\\coloneqq\\{r\\in\\omega^\\omega\\mid\\exists n\\ \\forall i\\ge n\\ r(i)=0\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Step}_X(P,(q,r),(q',r'))&\\Longleftrightarrow q<|P|\\land\\Bigl(\n\\exists i,j\\,[P_q=\\mathsf I(i,j)\\land q'=j\\land r'=r[i\\mapsto r(i)+1]]\\\\\n&\\quad\\lor\\exists i,j,k\\,[P_q=\\mathsf D(i,j,k)\\land\n((r(i)=0\\land q'=j\\land r'=r)\\\\\n&\\hspace{48mm}\\lor(r(i)>0\\land q'=k\\land r'=r[i\\mapsto r(i)-1]))]\\\\\n&\\quad\\lor\\exists i,j,k\\,[P_q=\\mathsf Q(i,j,k)\\land r'=r\\land\n((r(i)\\in X\\land q'=j)\\lor(r(i)\\notin X\\land q'=k))]\\Bigr),\\\\\nr_{\\vec x}(i)&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}x_i,&i<|\\vec x|,\\\\0,&i\\ge|\\vec x|,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{Run}_X(P,\\vec x,s)&\\Longleftrightarrow\ns\\in(\\omega\\times\\mathsf{Reg})^{<\\omega}\\land |s|>0\\land s_0=(0,r_{\\vec x})\\land\n\\forall i+1<|s|\\ \\operatorname{Step}_X(P,s_i,s_{i+1}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Halt}_X(P,\\vec x,y)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists s,q,r\\,[\\operatorname{Run}_X(P,\\vec x,s)\\land s_{|s|-1}=(q,r)\n\\land q<|P|\\land P_q=\\mathsf H\\land r(0)=y],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Comp}^{X}_k(f)&\\Longleftrightarrow(f:\\omega^k\\to\\omega)\\land\n\\exists P\\in\\mathsf{Prog}\\ \\forall\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\ \\operatorname{Halt}_X(P,\\vec x,f(\\vec x)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Comp}_{c_D,c_E}(f)&\\Longleftrightarrow(f:D\\to E)\\land\n\\exists P\\in\\mathsf{Prog}\\ \\forall x\\in D\\ \\operatorname{Halt}_{\\varnothing}(P,\\langle c_D(x)\\rangle,c_E(f(x))),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Rec}^{X}_k&\\coloneqq\\{R\\subseteq\\omega^k\\mid\\operatorname{Comp}^{X}_k(\\mathbf1_R)\\},\\quad\n\\mathbf1_R(\\vec x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&\\vec x\\in R,\\\\0,&\\vec x\\notin R,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\n\\mathsf{idx}(\\mathsf H)&\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\mathsf{idx}(\\mathsf I(i,j))\\coloneqq\\{i\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{idx}(\\mathsf D(i,j,k))=\\mathsf{idx}(\\mathsf Q(i,j,k))\\coloneqq\\{i\\},\\\\\nK(P,k)&\\coloneqq1+\\max\\bigl(\\{k\\}\\cup\\bigcup_{j<|P|}\\mathsf{idx}(P_j)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathsf{conf}_{P,k}(a)&\\coloneqq\n\\{(q,r)\\in\\omega\\times\\mathsf{Reg}\\mid\\exists s\\in\\omega^{K(P,k)}\\\\\n[a=\\mathsf{seq}(\\langle q\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}s)\\land\n\\forall i<K(P,k)\\ r(i)=s_i\\land\\forall i\\ge K(P,k)\\ r(i)=0]\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Trace}_X(P,\\vec x,w,y)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists s\\,[\\operatorname{Run}_X(P,\\vec x,s)\\land\n|s|=|\\mathsf{unseq}(w)|\\land\n\\forall i<|s|\\ s_i\\in\\mathsf{conf}_{P,|\\vec x|}(\\mathsf{unseq}(w)_i)\\\\\n&\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\exists q,r\\ (s_{|s|-1}=(q,r)\\land q<|P|\\land P_q=\\mathsf H\\land r(0)=y)],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Acc}(P,a,w)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists y\\ \\mathsf{Trace}_{\\varnothing}(P,\\langle a\\rangle,w,y),\\\\\n\\operatorname{RE}(T)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists P\\in\\mathsf{Prog}\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (n\\in T\\leftrightarrow\\exists y\\ \\operatorname{Halt}_{\\varnothing}(P,\\langle n\\rangle,y)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Comp}(f)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Comp}_{\\operatorname{id}_\\omega,\\operatorname{id}_\\omega}(f)\n\\quad(f:\\omega\\to\\omega).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{CodeSeq}_{c_D}(s)&\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf{seq}(\\langle c_D(s_i)\\mid i<|s|\\rangle)\n\\quad(s\\in D^{<\\omega}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{CodePair}_{c_D,c_E}(\\langle x,y\\rangle_{\\rm pair})&\\coloneqq\n\\pi(c_D(x),c_E(y))\\quad(x\\in D,y\\in E),\\\\\n\\mathsf{CodeFail}_{c_D,\\star}(z)&\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}0,&z=\\star,\\\\1+c_D(z),&z\\in D,\\end{cases}\n\\quad(z\\in D\\cup\\{\\star\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Inj}(\\mathsf{CodeSeq}_{c_D})&\\land\n\\operatorname{Inj}(\\mathsf{CodePair}_{c_D,c_E})\\land\n\\operatorname{Inj}(\\mathsf{CodeFail}_{c_D,\\star}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Comp}(f)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Comp}_{c_D,c_E}(f)\n\\quad(f:D\\to E),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Comp}_{c_D,c_E}(f)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists P\\in\\mathsf{Prog}\\ \\forall x\\in D\\ \\exists w\\in\\omega\\\n\\mathsf{Trace}_{\\varnothing}(P,\\langle c_D(x)\\rangle,w,c_E(f(x))),\\\\\nc_D&=\\{\\langle n,n\\rangle\\mid n\\in D\\}\n\\quad(D\\subseteq\\omega),\\qquad\nc_E=\\{\\langle n,n\\rangle\\mid n\\in E\\}\\quad(E\\subseteq\\omega).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf1_Y(n)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&n\\in Y,\\\\0,&n\\notin Y,\\end{cases}\n\\quad(Y\\subseteq\\omega,n\\in\\omega).","display":true}],"bytes":6240,"backlinks":[{"id":"d773e54334af93ea","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-effective-computation]]"},{"id":"824ea1d54ff527bd","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据